"V takes the class Afflicter, which deals lingering damage through bleeding, acid and fire."
"Her Afflicter trait lowers a target's resistance to lingering damage with every hit."
"She fights with wrist crossbows that fold on thought and bone claws from the backs of her hands."
"Her wrist launcher fires one napalm grenade a day that leaves a sticky pool of fire."
"She chooses to make her acid bolts heal allies, and Devin calls them vampiric bolts."
"She trains for a month under Pellia, a winged woman with frosty white skin."
"Her lingering damage restores allies' health, stamina and mana while it burns."
"Aurora keeps caged monsters so she can heal the wounded by hurting them."
"Her Concept is Affliction Healer, and she reaches Tier 2."
